Package: xenon-xws-thirdparty
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Enhances: xenon-xws
Description: DirectX-to-Vulkan translation and runtime installer for XWS
 Upstream release builds bundled for the Xenon Windows Subsystem:
  * DXVK: Direct3D 8/9/10/11 on Vulkan (zlib license)
  * VKD3D-Proton: Direct3D 12 on Vulkan (LGPL-2.1+)
  * winetricks: installs Microsoft runtimes on demand, downloading them
    from Microsoft (LGPL-2.1+)
 The Windows DLLs are copied into each user's Windows environment by XWS.
